  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1783771419_8661903_a5e00132373a7031000fd987a3c9f87b.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Daebak is a Korea-based subscription box bringing authentic Korean culture to fans in 100+ countries. Every box is curated straight from K-beauty, Korean snacks, K-pop merch, and lifestyle goods from brands you won't find on typical Western shelves.<br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0907/7427/4336/files/Daebak_Beauty_Box_1.webp?v=1782019759\" style=\"width:238px;max-width:100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"Daebak_Beauty_Box_1.webp?v=1782019759\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0907/7427/4336/files/2022_Summer_DBB.jpg?v=1777591307\" style=\"width:240px;max-width:100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"2022_Summer_DBB.jpg?v=1777591307\"></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>• What makes us different:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">We're actually <em>in</em> Korea - not a reseller. We work directly with Korean brands, so our boxes carry products straight from the source, often before they reach international shelves. Your audience gets genuine discovery, plus the built-in thrill of unboxing that's made for content.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Earn a <strong>10% commission on each new customer's first purchase</strong> through your unique affiliate link. Tracking and payouts run through our UpPromote portal, so you can see clicks, conversions, and commissions in real time. We ship to 100+ countries, so your audience can convert from almost anywhere.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Sign up: <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https://af.uppromote.com/daebakbox/register\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://af.uppromote.com/daebakbox/register</a></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">However you already create — unboxing videos, hauls, honest reviews, K-beauty routines, snack taste-tests, or gift guides. Drop your link in your bio, video descriptions, newsletters, or blog posts. Our boxes are visually rich and made for content.<br><br>Don't have a box in hand yet? No problem - our affiliate portal is stocked with ready-to-use product photos and videos you're free to use in your content. You'll also get a $3 discount code to share with your audience, giving them a reason to click and making your link that much easier to convert.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>• Other information:</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Unbox Korea is for our global community of Korean-culture lovers and creators. Whether your following is large or a small, deeply engaged niche, we welcome creators who genuinely love Korea and share honest reviews.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Learn more: <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https://daebak.co/pages/unbox-korea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://daebak.co/pages/unbox-korea</a></p><div class=\"form\" style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;border:0px;font-size:16px;background-position:50% center;background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;width:687.074px;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><div class=\"innerForm\" style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;border:0px;font-size:16px;width:687.074px;\"><div class=\"inputList\" style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;border:0px;font-size:16px;\"><br></div></div></div></div></div>",
